  "description": "With the Greer Carbon, HARO is launching its successful enduro concept as a pure carbon MTB frameset for the first time. The progressive geometry, 160 millimeters of rear suspension travel, and consistent design for modern enduro components make the frame the ideal platform for individual high-performance builds. The bike is delivered with the FOX FLOAT X2 Factory rear shock (Trunnion mount, 2-position adjustment, Kashima coating), ensuring maximum control, sensitivity, and downhill performance at the highest level.\nVisually, the Greer Carbon makes a clear statement: the street art-inspired graphics give the frame a distinctive, striking look and underline the progressive character of the bike – modern, urban, and unmistakable.\nThe carbon frame combines high stiffness, low weight, and maximum durability. Well-thought-out details, modern standards, and clean lines ensure a tidy setup – whether for ambitious racers or demanding enduro enthusiasts.",
